B.bdx=new A.w("logic","Challenge 955: I have keys but open no locks; space but no room; enter but not go inside. What am I?","A keyboard")
B.b21=new A.w("nature","[Set 31] I fall but never get hurt; I blanket the world in white silence. What am I?","Snow")
B.b4J=new A.w("nature","Deep riddle #957 \u2014 I have no lungs yet I hold every breath of the forest. What am I?","A tree")
B.b7T=new A.w("mystery","[Set 31] I am seen in mirrors yet never in the same room twice. What am I?","Your reflection leaving")
B.b9_=new A.w("mystery","[Set 31] Doors open for me though I carry no key; time is my ally. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A habit")
B.b9z=new A.w("wordplay","Challenge 960: What word becomes shorter when you add two letters to it?","Short (adding -er)")
B.b9f=new A.w("logic","Logic puzzle #992: a number times itself minus 82 equals 7314. What is the number?","86")
B.bfL=new A.w("love","[Set 32] I have a heart that never beats yet lovers chase me across centuries. What am I?","A love letter")
B.b9q=new A.w("love","[Set 32] Two share me but neither owns me alone; without trust I vanish. What am I?","A secret")
B.bfh=new A.w("love","Deep riddle #963 \u2014 I grow when given away in romance yet shrink when hoarded in silence. What am I?","Affection")
B.bcm=new A.w("love","[Set 32] I bind no rope yet hold two souls tighter than chains. What am I?","A vow")
B.bdg=new A.w("love","Challenge 965: Seen in eyes before spoken on lips; I arrive first at every true meeting. What am I?","Recognition")
B.b6n=new A.w("bible","Deep riddle #966 \u2014 I swallowed a man yet could not digest his prayer; I returned him on the third dawn. What am I? (Think carefully.)","The great fish")
B.b2z=new A.w("bible","[Set 32] Built with pitch and gopher wood, I rode forty days of rain. What am I?","Noah's ark")
B.b7m=new A.w("bible","[Set 32] I parted for a nation fleeing; walls of me stood like guards then fell flat. What am I?","The Red Sea")
